   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Two female colleagues working together to design t-shirt print in bright, modern office. One girl sitting at workplace and preparing to draw sketch on white t-shirt, other measuring something on desk.</rdf:li>
